  "sourceFindings": [
    "First focused run retained5self-verification failures caused by public certificate serial leading-zero normalization. Fixed the unsigned comparison and added deterministic low/high-bit serial cases;15focusedcases then passed.",
    "First four-TFM compile found the older Standard2.0 reference enum lacks the EphemeralKeySet name. Use the documented flag32 only after verifying actual runtime support; never substitute persisted key storage.",
    "Existing appearance-regeneration requests reject before preparation/signing instead of silently clearing the form-wide flag.",
    "Certification inspection now covers direct nested signature dictionaries and rejects malformed catalog protection; two structural-policy cases prevent a writer bypass.",
    "Original visual checker used MuPDF unsigned-widget placeholder as signed baseline. Retained original failure and exact checker diff/hashes; use unchanged prior geometry/color/page-size labels. No SDK output/label/permission/threshold changed."
  ],
